## 4. Not applied (and why)

b#20 — thousands separator "1.579.589 TWD" → "1 579 589 TWD" (and TWD 25.000.000 in 011/017/018).
  NOT applied. scripts/check-column-translation.mjs sets NUMBER_THOUSAND_STYLE.pl = 'dot'; with spaces the
  parser reads 1 579 589 as three numbers (1, 579, 589) and `numbers` FAILs ("missing from translation").
  Verified directly: analyzeNumbers("kwota 1 579 589 TWD","pl") → [1,579,589]. Per the WO ("prefer the form
  the checker accepts and note it"), the dot form stays. A follow-up would need the checker changed first.
  (The "TWD 1.57M" English decimal in the team bio WAS fixed → "1,57 mln TWD"; that one parses identically.)

b#47 — "rangą 1 dziedziczenia ustawowego" → the reviewer's "pierwszej grupy". Applied as
  "grupy 1 dziedziczenia ustawowego": the word "ranga" (German Rang) is gone and "grupa/krąg" is used
  throughout, but the digit 1 is kept because the ko source carries it and the pl word-numeral lexicon
  only maps cardinals (jeden/dwa/…), not ordinals ("pierwszej" would drop the token and FAIL `numbers`).
  Same reason for keeping "2 państwami" in 007 §1 and "1 poszkodowanego / 1 wypadku" in 003 Q15.

a#30 (part) — "Taipei → Tajpej" was applied (see §2), but the office *addresses* and the Latin-script firm
  names (Hovering International Law Firm, National Taiwan University) were left untouched per R5.

## 5. Where I disagree with the reviewer (not applied as suggested)

1. b#1 — reviewer: "Byłam adwokatką (訴訟代理人) powoda". 訴訟代理人 is not "adwokatka"; per RULEBOOK R8 it is the
   litigation representative. Written as "Byłam pełnomocnikiem procesowym (訴訟代理人) powoda — koreańskiego
   studenta": the feminine verb "Byłam" carries the gender (R4) and the term is now correct (R8).
2. a#16 — reviewer: "…na przykład Polską i Tajwanem". Not applied (ACCEPTED-pl says apply as R2d): the neutral
   "z 2 państwami lub terytoriami albo z większą ich liczbą (na przykład z Tajwanem i innym państwem)" avoids
   asserting anything about Polish law, as the rulebook requires.
3. a#24 — reviewer: "1,57 mln TWD" in the team bio: applied, but as "wyrok pierwszej instancji zasądzający
   1,57 mln TWD" (a judgment is "zasądzający kwotę", not "wyrok na kwotę").
4. b#37 — reviewer says "wskazówka" is wrong in 015–017 too. Only the 014 instance is 函釋 (administrative
   interpretation) and it was changed; the others are link labels for official *guidance pages*
   ("Wskazówka Ministerstwa …"), where "wskazówka" is correct. Left as is.
5. b#42 — the "część pogłębiona N" calque was fixed as "omówienie pogłębione N" (005/013/015 titles, H1 and
   cross-links), not with the reviewer's em-dash retitling, so the existing en-dash title pattern is kept.
6. a#47 — "(Czy nie zdradzam tu mimowolnie swojego wieku?)" could not be deleted (block counts are fixed), so
   it was rewritten as "(To już wspomnienie sprzed wielu lat.)".

